<body style='tab-interval:.5in'>
<div class=Section1>
﻿<div id="divCont" style="background:#ffffff;border:none;margin:auto;"><div class="INDEXES_ON_REF" style="display:none"><label id="s5987"></label><a id="onLBC-6663873">[<b>OKOZ:</b><div id="LBC6533"><span class="iorRN">1.</span><span class="iorVal">06.00.00.00 Ijtimoiy ta’minot va ijtimoiy sug‘urta to‘g‘risidagi qonunchilik. Ijtimoiy himoya / 06.10.00.00 Nogironlar va fuqarolarning boshqa toifalarining ijtimoiy himoyasi]</span></div></a></div><div class="INDEXES_ON_REF" style="display:none"><label id="s5988"></label><a id="onLS-6663873">[<b>TSZ:</b><div id="LS3698"><span class="iorRN">1.</span><span class="iorVal">Ijtimoiy-madaniy masalalar / Ijtimoiy sug‘urta, ijtimoiy ta’minot va ijtimoiy himoya]</span></div></a></div><div class="ACCEPTING_BODY"><a id="-6665757">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Vazirlar Mahkamasining</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6665758">qarori</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE"><a id="-6665759">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash va ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash bo‘yicha elektron shaklda ariza berishni joriy etish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6665761"></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665764">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining “2022 — 2026-yillarga mo‘ljallangan Yangi O‘zbekistonning taraqqiyot strategiyasini “Insonga e’tibor va sifatli ta’lim yili”da amalga oshirishga oid davlat dasturi to‘g‘risida” 2023-yil 28-fevraldagi PF-27-son <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-6396146">Farmoni </a>ijrosini ta’minlash, shuningdek, ijtimoiy himoya qilish tizimiga axborot-kommunikatsiya texnologiyalari joriy etilishini kengaytirish hamda kam ta’minlangan oilalarga ijtimoiy yordamlar ko‘rsatish tartibini yanada takomillashtirish maqsadida Vazirlar Mahkamasi qaror qiladi:</a></div><div class="COMMENT" style="display:none"><label id="s527"></label><div class="COMMENTLEXUZ"><img src="/image/favicon.gif"> LexUZ sharhi</img></div></div><div class="COMMENT" style="display:none"><label id="s527"></label><a id="-6675023">Qarang: Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2021-yil 21-oktabrdagi 654-son “Aholini ijtimoiy himoya qilish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida”gi <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101">qarori.</a></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665765">1. 2024-yil 1-apreldan boshlab kam ta’minlangan oilalarga bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlash uchun onlayn ariza berish bo‘yicha davlat xizmatini ko‘rsatish yo‘lga qo‘yilsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665766">Bunda O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti huzuridagi Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi bilan birgalikda 2024-yil 1-aprelga qadar:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665767">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash va ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma taqdim etish bo‘yicha elektron shaklda davlat xizmatini ko‘rsatishni Yagona interaktiv davlat xizmatlari portali (keyingi o‘rinlarda — YIDXP) orqali joriy etadi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665768">davlat xizmatini ko‘rsatishni YIDXP orqali joriy etish bo‘yicha texnik hujjatlarni tasdiqlaydi hamda O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Adliya vazirligi bilan birgalikda tegishli axborot tizimlarining o‘zaro integratsiya qilinishini ta’minlaydi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665769">YIDXPda davlat xizmatlari ko‘rsatilishining har bir bosqichida murojaatlar ko‘rib chiqilishini kuzatib borish tartibini joriy etadi.</a></div><div class="INDEXES_ON_REF" style="display:none"><label id="s5987"></label><a id="onLBC-6665772">[<b>OKOZ:</b><div id="LBC5993"><span class="iorRN">1.</span><span class="iorVal">01.00.00.00 Konstitutsiyaviy tuzum / 01.05.00.00 Aholi / 01.05.11.00 Aholini ro‘yxatga olish;</span></div><div id="LBC22729"><span class="iorRN">2.</span><span class="iorVal">18.00.00.00 Prokuratura. Advokatura. Notariat. Yuridik xizmat. Adliya organlari. FHDY organlari / 18.05.00.00 Adliya organlari / 18.05.01.00 Adliya organlarining tizimi va tashkiliy tuzilmasi]</span></div></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665772">2. O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Adliya vazirligi huzuridagi Personallashtirish agentligi bir hafta muddatda O‘zbekiston Respublikasidan chiqib ketgan va O‘zbekiston Respublikasiga kelgan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi fuqarolari, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi hududida yashash guvohnomasiga ega bo‘lgan chet el fuqarolari yoki fuqaroligi bo‘lmagan shaxslar to‘g‘risidagi hamda ularning chet elga borish maqsadlari to‘g‘risidagi elektron ma’lumotlar “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimiga “Elektron hukumat” tizimi idoralararo integratsiyalashuv platformasi orqali taqdim etib borilishini yo‘lga qo‘ysin.</a></div><div class="INDEXES_ON_REF" style="display:none"><label id="s5987"></label><a id="onLBC-6665774">[<b>OKOZ:</b><div id="LBC9109"><span class="iorRN">1.</span><span class="iorVal">06.00.00.00 Ijtimoiy ta’minot va ijtimoiy sug‘urta to‘g‘risidagi qonunchilik. Ijtimoiy himoya / 06.07.00.00 Nafaqalar. Kompensatsiya to‘lovlari / 06.07.03.00 Kam ta’minlanganlar, “Ayollar daftari”, “Yoshlar daftari”, “Temir daftar” va boshqa toifalardagi fuqarolarga moddiy yordam ko‘rsatish;</span></div><div id="LBC7269"><span class="iorRN">2.</span><span class="iorVal">12.00.00.00 Axborot va axborotlashtirish / 12.01.00.00 Axborot va axborotlashtirish sohasining umumiy qoidalari]</span></div></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665774">3. 2024-yil 1-apreldan boshlab “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlarining ijtimoiy xodimlariga fuqarolarning bevosita roziligi bilan “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash va ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash bo‘yicha elektron shaklda ariza berish huquqi berilsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665777">4. Kuyidagilar:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665779">a) O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665798">Soliq qo‘mitasining ish haqi fondi to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlariga asoslanib, mulkchilik shaklidan qat’i nazar, ish beruvchilar tomonidan har bir xodim bo‘yicha mehnat va fuqarolik-huquqiy shartnomalarni “Yagona milliy mehnat tizimi” idoralararo dasturiy-apparat kompleksida ro‘yxatdan o‘z vaqtida o‘tkazilishi bo‘yicha nazorat tadbirlarini kuchaytirsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665799">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlash rad etilgan, shuningdek, aholi bandligi masalalari bo‘yicha maslahat olish uchun mehnat organlariga murojaat qilganligi sababli rasmiy bandlik talab etilmasdan bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam tayinlangan hamda ketma-ket ikki va undan ortiq marotaba ijtimoiy nafaqalar olayotgan oilalar bandligini ta’minlash hamda ularning daromadlarini oshirish yuzasidan aniq choralar ko‘rib borsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665802">b) 2024-yil 1-yanvarga qadar:</a></div><div class="INDEXES_ON_REF" style="display:none"><label id="s5987"></label><a id="onLBC-6665803">[<b>OKOZ:</b><div id="LBC7269"><span class="iorRN">1.</span><span class="iorVal">12.00.00.00 Axborot va axborotlashtirish / 12.01.00.00 Axborot va axborotlashtirish sohasining umumiy qoidalari]</span></div></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665803">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Sog‘liqni saqlash vazirligi gematologiya, onkologiya, immunologiya va boshqa uzoq muddatli davolanishni talab etadigan kasalliklar bilan kasallangan shaxslar to‘g‘risida yagona elektron ma’lumotlar bazasini ishlab chiqsin va uning “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimiga integratsiya qilinishini ta’minlasin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665804">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Ichki ishlar vazirligi Tashqi ishlar vazirligi bilan birgalikda chet elda sudning qonuniy kuchga kirgan hukmi bo‘yicha jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida bo‘lgan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi fuqarolari to‘g‘risidagi yagona elektron ma’lumotlar bazasini ishlab chiqib, ma’lumotlar “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimiga taqdim etib borilishini yo‘lga qo‘ysin;</a></div><div class="INDEXES_ON_REF" style="display:none"><label id="s5987"></label><a id="onLBC-6665805">[<b>OKOZ:</b><div id="LBC7491"><span class="iorRN">1.</span><span class="iorVal">16.00.00.00 Xavfsizlik va huquq tartibot muhofazasi / 16.02.00.00 Xavfsizlikni ta’minlash kuchlari / 16.02.05.00 Ichki ishlar organlari]</span></div></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665805">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Ichki ishlar vazirligi avtotransport vositalari to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar bazasiga transport vositasining rusumi, dvigatel quvvati va boshqa zarur ko‘rsatkichlar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlarni majburiy kiritish tizimini joriy etsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665806">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Energetika vazirligi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi bilan birgalikda “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi “Hududiy elektr tarmoqlari” AJning axborot tizimi bilan integratsiya qilinishini ta’minlasin hamda kam ta’minlangan oilalarga bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlash uchun murojaat qilgan oilalarning elektr energiyasi xarajatlari to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlarni taqdim etish tartibini joriy etsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665807">Soliq qo‘mitasi ishlovchi onalar yoki ularning o‘rnini bosuvchi shaxslarga (budjet tashkilotlarida ishlaydigan onalar yoki ularning o‘rnini bosuvchi shaxslar bundan mustasno) bola ikki yoshga yetguncha uni parvarishlash uchun beriladigan nafaqalar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimiga taqdim etilishini ta’minlasin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665808">5. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Aholini ijtimoiy himoya qilish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 21-oktabrdagi 654-son <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5690229">qaroriga</a> <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/6663873#-6665823">1-ilovaga</a> muvofiq o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritilsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665809">Belgilansinki:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665810">kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash mezonlariga kiritilayotgan o‘zgartirishlar 2023-yil 15-noyabrdan so‘ng taqdim etilgan arizalarga nisbatan joriy etiladi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665811">mazkur qarorga 1-ilovaning <a href="javascript:scrollText(-6666888)">7-bandi </a>2024-yil 1-apreldan boshlab kuchga kiradi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665812">6. O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining<a href="javascript:scrollText(-6667368)"> 2-ilovaga </a>muvofiq ayrim qarorlari o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblansin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665813">7. O‘zbekiston Milliy axborot agentligi O‘zbekiston Milliy teleradiokompaniyasi, Axborot va ommaviy kommunikatsiyalar agentligi bilan birgalikda ushbu qarorning maqsadi, vazifalari va undan kutilayotgan natijalar ommaviy axborot vositalari, shu jumladan, internet va ijtimoiy tarmoqlarda keng yoritilishini tashkil etsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6665817">8. Mazkur qarorning bajarilishini nazorat qilish O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Bosh vazirining o‘rinbosari — iqtisodiyot va moliya vaziri J.A. Qo‘chqorov hamda O‘zbekiston Respublikasi raqamli texnologiyalar vaziri Sh.X. Shermatov zimmasiga yuklansin.</a></div><div class="SIGNATURE"><a id="-6665818">O‘zbekiston Respublikasining Bosh vaziri A. ARIPOV</a></div><div class="ACT_ESSENTIAL_ELEMENTS"><a id="-6665819">Toshkent sh.,</a></div><div class="ACT_ESSENTIAL_ELEMENTS"><a id="-6665820">2023-yil 10-noyabr,</a></div><div class="ACT_ESSENTIAL_ELEMENTS_NUM"><a id="-6665821">596-son</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6665823"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6665824">Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2023-yil 10-noyabrdagi 596-son <a href="javascript:scrollText()">qaroriga</a><br />1-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6665826">Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Aholini ijtimoiy himoya qilish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 21-oktabrdagi 654-son qaroriga kiritilayotgan o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666073"></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666075">1. <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691572">1-band </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666078">“1. Quyidagilar:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666080">Kam ta’minlangan oilalarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali aniqlash, ularga kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash va to‘lash tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizom 1-ilovaga muvofiq;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666083">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash, ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza berish bo‘yicha davlat xizmati ko‘rsatishning ma’muriy reglamenti 2-ilovaga muvofiq;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666085">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimidagi idoralararo elektron o‘zaro axborot almashinuvi doirasidagi ma’lumotlar ro‘yxati 3-ilovaga muvofiq tasdiqlansin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666088">Belgilansinki, mazkur bandning uchinchi xatboshisi 2024-yil 1-apreldan boshlab amalga kiritiladi”.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666090">2. <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691578">2-banddagi </a>“Davlat soliq qo‘mitasi” so‘zlari “Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666095">3. 3-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691579">birinchi xatboshisidagi </a>“Moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari “Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666097">4. 4-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691581">birinchi xatboshisidagi </a>“Moliya vazirligi va Iqtisodiy taraqqiyot va kambag‘allikni qisqartirish vazirligining” so‘zlari “Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi hamda Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligining” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666099">5. <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691584">5-band </a>o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblansin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666155">6. <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691606">1-ilovada</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666156">2-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691621">ikkinchi xatboshisi</a> “oilaning 18 yoshga to‘lgan” so‘zlaridan keyin “va 18 yoshga to‘lmagan farzandi bor” so‘zlari bilan to‘ldirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666157"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691627">3-band </a>o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666158"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691646">7-band </a>quyidagi mazmundagi xatboshi bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666159">“Bunda oilaning daromadlari kam ta’minlanganlik mezoniga muvofiqligini aniqlashda minimal iste’mol xarajatlarining yangi miqdori Statistika agentligi tomonidan rasman e’lon qilingan oydan keyingi oyning 1-sanasidan boshlab bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlash uchun taqdim etilgan arizalarga qo‘llaniladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666160"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691693">15-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666161"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691693">birinchi xatboshidagi </a>“Moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari “Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666162"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691714">oltinchi xatboshi </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666163">“Oilaning mavjud chorva mollari va parrandalari, arizachi va uning oila a’zolari nomiga rasmiylashtirilmagan, biroq foydalanuvida bo‘lgan avtotransport vositalari, bog‘ va dehqon xo‘jalik yerlari, ijarasidan yoki boshqa faoliyatdan olingan daromad ushbu oilaga kelib tushadigan noturar joylari to‘g‘risida ushbu Nizomga 3a-ilovaga muvofiq shakl bo‘yicha ma’lumot”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666164">17-bandning<a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5691745"> ikkinchi xatboshisidagi </a>“3” raqami “1” raqami bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666165"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692025">20-band </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666166">“20. Quyidagi holatlar mavjud bo‘lganda, oilani kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etish va unga tegishli ravishda bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordamni tayinlash rad etiladi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666167">a) ariza beruvchi oilasining har bir a’zosiga to‘g‘ri keladigan bir oylik o‘rtacha jami daromad ushbu Nizomning 7-bandida belgilangan mezondan oshganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666168">b) idoralararo elektron axborot tizimi orqali olingan ma’lumotlar bo‘yicha Ko‘chmas mulk obyektlariga bo‘lgan huquqlarning davlat reyestrida jami bittadan ortiq ko‘chmas mulk va yer uchastkasi yoki bir va undan ortiq noturar joylari mavjud bo‘lganda.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666169">Ushbu Nizomga 3a-ilovaga muvofiq olingan ma’lumotlar bo‘yicha ariza beruvchi yoki uning oila a’zolari foydalanuvida bo‘lgan bir va undan ortiq daromad olib keluvchi noturar joylari mavjud bo‘lganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666170">v) ariza beruvchi yoki uning oila a’zolarida qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan tartibda o‘z nomiga rasmiylashtirilgan yoki ushbu Nizomga 3a-ilovadagi shakl bo‘yicha ma’lumotnomaga muvofiq ariza beruvchi yoki uning oila a’zolari foydalanuvida bo‘lgan yoxud ishonchnomaga asosan quyidagilar mavjud bo‘lganda:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666171">ishlab chiqarilgan muddati 12 (oila a’zosi I yoki II guruh va 18 yoshgacha bolalikdan nogiron bo‘lsa 7) yildan oshmagan, texnik holati soz bo‘lgan yengil avtotransport vositasi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666172">ishlab chiqarilgan muddati 15 yildan oshmagan, texnik holati soz bo‘lgan yuk tashuvchi avtotransport vositasi, avtobus, mikroavtobus, ekskavator, traktor, kombayn, yuk tashuvchi avtotransport vositalarining tirkamalari va yarim tirkamalari, avtokran va boshqa qurilish texnikasi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666173">jami ikki va undan ortiq, texnik holati soz bo‘lgan yengil va yuk tashuvchi avtotransport vositalari, mikroavtobus, ekskavator, traktor, kombayn, yuk tashuvchi avtotransport vositalarining tirkamalari va yarim tirkamalari, avtokran va boshqa qurilish texnikasi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666174">g) ariza beruvchi va uning oila a’zolarining tijorat banklaridagi depozit hisobvaraqlarida ariza berilgan oyda amalda bo‘lgan mehnatga haq to‘lash eng kam miqdorining besh baravari va undan ortiq miqdorda mablag‘lari mavjud bo‘lganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666175">d) ariza beruvchi va uning oila a’zolarida ariza berilgan oyda bozor qiymati mehnatga haq to‘lash eng kam miqdorining besh baravari va undan ortiq summani tashkil etuvchi qimmatli qog‘ozlar mavjud bo‘lganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666176">e) O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Mudofaa vazirligi, Ichki ishlar vazirligi, Favqulodda vaziyatlar vazirligi, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Milliy gvardiya, Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Bojxona qo‘mitasi, Mudofaa vazirligi huzuridagi Mudofaa sanoati agentligi hamda ularning tizimidagi tashkilotlarning xizmatchilari va xodimlari yoki ularning oila a’zolari (eri (xotini) va bolalari), shuningdek, pensionerlari tomonidan arizalar taqdim etilganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666177">j) Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2019-yil 9-yanvardagi 11-son qarori bilan tasdiqlangan Sudyalar va ularning oila a’zolari pensiya ta’minoti shartlari, me’yorlari hamda tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomga asosan pensiyalar bilan ta’minlanganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666178">z) bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam oluvchi va uning oila a’zosi tomonidan takroriy ariza ushbu Nizomning 12-bandida belgilangan tartibga rioya etilmagan holda taqdim etilganda. Bunda takroran taqdim etilgan ariza “Yagona reyestr” ATga kiritilgandan so‘ng ariza ko‘rib chiqilmasdan, arizachiga rad javobi arizada ko‘rsatilgan elektron manzilga yoki SMS-xabar orqali mobil telefon raqamiga jo‘natiladi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666179">i) oilada kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlari tomonidan tayinlangan ishsizlik nafaqasini olayotgan a’zolari mavjud bo‘lganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666181">k) oilaning oxirgi 12 oy davomida ish qidirayotgan a’zosi tomonidan kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlarining maqbul keladigan ishga doir takliflarini muntazam ravishda (ikki va undan ortiq marta) rad etilgan hollarda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666183">l) rasmiy daromad manbalariga ega bo‘lmagan va oxirgi olti oy mobaynida ish izlab kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlariga murojaat qilmagan hamda kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlarida hisobda turmagan, o‘zini o‘zi band qilgan shaxslar ro‘yxatiga kiritilmagan yoki haq to‘lanadigan jamoat ishlari ishtirokchisi hisoblanmagan mehnatga layoqatli oila a’zosi mavjud bo‘lganda.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666186">Ushbu qoida quyidagilarga nisbatan qo‘llanilmaydi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666188">bola uch yoshga to‘lguniga qadar parvarish qilayotgan onalarga (ularning o‘rnini bosuvchi shaxslarga);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666189">ta’lim muassasalarida o‘qiyotganlarga (ta’limning kechki va sirtqi shakllari bundan mustasno);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666193">ishlamaydigan pensionerlarga, davlat pensiyasi tayinlash uchun zarur ish stajiga ega bo‘lmagan shaxslarga va mehnatga layoqatsizlik yuzasidan nafaqa oluvchi fuqarolarga, OIV infeksiyasiga chalingan shaxslarga, I yoki II guruh va bolalikdan nogironligi bo‘lgan 18 yoshgacha shaxslarga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666194">2024-yil 16-avgustga qadar ariza taqdim etgan arizachi yoki oila a’zolari nomiga rasmiylashtirilgan tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritish bilan band bo‘lgan faqat bitta oila a’zosiga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666195">18 yoshgacha bolalikdan nogironligi bo‘lgan, shu jumladan, OIV infeksiyasiga chalingan shaxslarning onalariga (onasi bo‘lmagan holda otasiga), oila a’zosi hisoblangan I guruh nogironligi bo‘lgan shaxsni yoki o‘zgalar parvarishiga muhtoj bo‘lgan 80 yoshga to‘lgan keksalarni parvarish qilayotganlarga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666196">chet elda ishlaydigan yoki chet elda tadbirkorlik va boshqa faoliyatni amalga oshiruvchi oila a’zolariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666202">sudning qonuniy kuchga kirgan hukmi bo‘yicha jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida bo‘lganligi munosabati bilan oilada bo‘lmagan a’zolariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666204">oilaning chaqiriq bo‘yicha harbiy xizmatni o‘tayotgan a’zolariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666205">bolasini yolg‘iz tarbiyalayotgan yolg‘iz onalar (otalar)ga hamda nikohi bekor qilingan ayollarga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666206">rasmiy daromad manbalariga ega bo‘lmagan “Temir daftar” ro‘yxatida bo‘lgan oilalarga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666208">tuman (shahar) kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish bo‘limlariga ish qidiruvchi sifatida rasmiy murojaat qilgan yoki ishsiz sifatida ro‘yxatga olingan, ushbu bo‘lim tomonidan kasbga tayyorlashga, qayta tayyorlashga yoki malaka oshirishga yuborilgan, shuningdek, o‘zini o‘zi band qilgan fuqarolar ro‘yxatiga kiritilgan shaxslarga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666210">to‘rt va undan ortiq o‘n sakkiz yoshga to‘lmagan farzandi mavjud bo‘lgan oilaning mehnatga layoqatli har bir a’zosiga nisbatan. Bunda 2024-yil 16-maydan boshlab taqdim etilgan arizalar bo‘yicha arizachi yoki oila a’zosi I yoki II guruh va 18 yoshgacha bolalikdan nogiron oila a’zosi bo‘lganda ushbu qoida qo‘llaniladi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666212">ruhiy kasalliklar bo‘yicha dispanser hisobida turgan oila a’zolariga nisbatan;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666213">m) 2024-yil 16-iyuldan boshlab ariza taqdim etgan ariza beruvchi yoki uning oila a’zolari faqat Soliq qo‘mitasining fuqarolarning ish haqining yakka tartibdagi hisobini yuritishning markazlashtirilgan elektron reyestri ma’lumotlarida ish haqi to‘g‘risida ma’lumotlari mavjud, biroq uning mehnat yoki fuqarolik-huquqiy shartnomalari “Yagona milliy mehnat tizimi” idoralararo dasturiy-apparat kompleksida hisobda turmaganda.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666214">Mazkur bandda ko‘rsatilgan mezonlar asosida bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam tayinlash rad etilganda, ariza beruvchiga xabar “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali rad etish sabablari ko‘rsatilgan holda elektron shaklda (arizada ko‘rsatilgan elektron manziliga yoki SMS-xabarlar orqali mobil telefon raqamiga) yuboriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666215">O‘zini o‘zi band qilgan fuqarolar Soliq qo‘mitasining “Yagona reyestr” AT tomonidan elektron so‘rov yuborilgan kunda o‘zini o‘zi band qilgan shaxslar tomonidan mehnat staji hisoblanishi uchun qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan (to‘liq) miqdorda ijtimoiy soliq to‘langanda hisobga olinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666218">Mazkur bandning faqat “k” kichik bandi asosida bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlash rad etilgan oilalar “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali belgilangan tartibda kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etiladi. Bunda oilaga bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlanmaydi, biroq mazkur Nizomga 1-ilovaga muvofiq shakl bo‘yicha ma’lumotnoma taqdim etiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666221">Bolasini yolg‘iz tarbiyalayotgan yolg‘iz onalar (otalar) hamda nikohi bekor qilingan ayollar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar Adliya vazirligi “FHDYning yagona elektron arxivi” axborot tizimidan olingan elektron ma’lumotlarga asosan aniqlashtiriladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666226"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692059">21-banddagi </a>“o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi tomonidan oilaning tarkibi bo‘yicha” so‘zlari “o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi va arizachi tomonidan” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666229"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692062">22-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666230"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692062">birinchi xatboshida </a>“murojaat qilingan” so‘zlaridan keyin “yoki iqtisodiy ahvoli o‘zgarishi qayta o‘rganilayotgan” so‘zlari bilan to‘ldirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666233"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692064">uchinchi xatboshi </a>“shaxslar” so‘zidan keyin “yoki rasman nikohi bekor qilinmagan aliment to‘layotgan er (xotin)” so‘zlari bilan to‘ldirilsin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666238">23-bandning <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692079">o‘n beshinchi xatboshisi </a>chiqarib tashlansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666241"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692080">24-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666244"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692080">birinchi xatboshi </a>“Yakka tartibdagi tadbirkorlik” so‘zlaridan keyin “va yakka tartibdagi tadbirkorning har bir yollangan xodimi” so‘zlari bilan to‘ldirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666246"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692082">uchinchi xatboshi </a>“miqdori aniqlanmasa” degan so‘zlardan keyin “yoki o‘tkazmalar miqdori mehnatga haq to‘lash eng kam miqdorining ikki baravari miqdoridan kam bo‘lsa” degan so‘zlar bilan to‘ldirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666248">quyidagi mazmundagi to‘rtinchi xatboshi bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666249">“Bunda O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Adliya vazirligi huzuridagi Personallashtirish agentligi axborot tizimidan olingan ma’lumotlarda ariza berilgan sanadan kamida bir oy avval O‘zbekiston Respublikasidan chiqib ketgan va O‘zbekiston Respublikasiga qaytmaganligi qayd etilgan fuqaro chet elda ishlaydigan yoki chet elda tadbirkorlik va boshqa faoliyatni amalga oshiruvchi shaxs sifatida qabul qilinadi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666251"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692083">to‘rtinchi xatboshi </a>beshinchi xatboshi deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666253"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692087">26-band </a>o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666256"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692113">27-band </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666259">“27. Arizachi yoki oila a’zolarining yakka tartibda uy-joy qurish uchun ajratilgan yer maydonida tomorqa maydonini hisoblashda O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Kadastr agentligining axborot tizimidan elektron axborot almashinuvi orqali olingan hamda ushbu Nizomga 3a-ilovaga muvofiq ma’lumotda yoki 6-ilovaga muvofiq dalolatnomada aks ettirilgan ma’lumotlar asosida kuyidagi formuladan foydalaniladi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666263">TEM = UM — QM — (UM * 20 %) bunda:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666265">TEM — tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligi maydoni;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666267">UM — ajratilgan erning umumiy maydoni (m<sup>2</sup>);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666272">QM — qurilishlarning maydoni (m<sup>2</sup>);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666274">(UM * 20 %) ko‘rsatkichi 200 m<sup>2</sup>dan oshmagan holda hisob-kitob uchun qabul qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666277">Tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritishdan olingan daromad miqdori sifatida ushbu bandda belgilangan tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritishdan olinadigan bir oylik daromadning normativ miqdori qabul qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666289">Tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritishdan olinadigan bir oylik o‘rtacha normativ daromad tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritish uchun foydalanilayotgan sotixlar maydonini jami daromad aniqlanayotgan davrda belgilangan mehnatga haq to‘lash eng kam miqdorining 0,035 baravariga ko‘paytirish yo‘li bilan aniqlanadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666290">Ushbu bandda ko‘rsatilgan bir oylik o‘rtacha normativ daromadi oilaning o‘rtacha oylik daromadini aniqlash uchun uch oyga ko‘paytirilgan holda hisob-kitob qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666292">2024-yil 16-avgustga qadar ariza taqdim etgan tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligi maydonida oilaning faqat bir nafar mehnatga layoqatli ishsiz a’zosi tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritish bilan band bo‘lgan deb hisoblanadi. Bunda:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666295">oila a’zolari tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritish bilan birinchi navbatda, mehnatga layoqatli ishsiz bo‘lgan, bola parvarishi va o‘zganing parvarishiga muhtoj bo‘lgan oila a’zosining parvarishi bilan band bo‘lmagan, jazoni ijro etish joylarida jazoni o‘tamayotgan, chet elda ishlamaydigan yoki tadbirkorlik va boshqa faoliyatni amalga oshirmayotgan oila a’zosi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666297">oilaning voyaga yetgan, ta’lim muassasasida tahsil olmayotgan, jazoni ijro etish joylarida jazoni o‘tamayotgan yoki chaqiriq bo‘yicha harbiy xizmatni o‘tamayotgan, o‘zganing parvarishiga muhtoj bo‘lgan oila a’zosining parvarishi bilan band bo‘lmagan, chet elda ishlamaydigan yoki tadbirkorlik va boshqa faoliyatni amalga oshirmayotgan, o‘z oilasiga ega bo‘lmagan mehnatga layoqatli ishsiz farzandiga, shuningdek, farzandlikka olingan yoki vasiylikka qabul qilingan shaxs (bir nechta farzandi bo‘lganda — yosh ketma-ketligi bo‘yicha);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666299">ta’lim muassasasida tahsil olmayotgan, jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida jazoni o‘tamayotgan yoki chaqiriq bo‘yicha harbiy xizmatni o‘tamayotgan, o‘zganing parvarishiga muhtoj bo‘lgan oila a’zosining parvarishi bilan band bo‘lmagan, chet elda ishlamaydigan yoki tadbirkorlik va boshqa faoliyatni amalga oshirmayotgan mehnatga layoqatli ishsiz otasi band bo‘lgan deb hisobga olinadi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666301"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692148">30-band </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666311">“30. Ariza beruvchi oilaning hamda iqtisodiy ahvoli o‘zgarishi qayta o‘rganilayotgan oilaning bir a’zosiga to‘g‘ri keladigan bir oylik o‘rtacha jami daromad miqdori quyidagi formula asosida aniqlanadi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666314">BOO‘D — (MHTD+MD+OA-TA+TU+IN+JIMH+SND+YTTND+PO‘+PN+ TD+ChM+BD)/OAS/3 bunda:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666317">BOO‘D — oilaning bir a’zosiga to‘g‘ri keladigan bir oylik o‘rtacha jami daromad;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666322">MHTD — mehnatga haq to‘lash shaklidagi uch oylik daromadlar (mazkur Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666324">MD — uch oylik mulkiy daromadlar (ushbu Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666326">OA — oila a’zolari tomonidan olingan uch oylik alimentlar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666328">TA — oila a’zolari tomonidan to‘langan uch oylik alimentlar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666330">TU — tashkilot ta’sischisiga qo‘llaniladigan normativ daromad;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666333">IN — kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlari tomonidan ishsiz fuqarolarga to‘langan uch oylik ishsizlik nafaqasi (mazkur Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666334">JIMH — qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan tartibda haq to‘lanadigan jamoat ishlarida qatnashganlik uchun shaxsga to‘langan uch oylik mehnat haqi (mazkur Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda);</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666336">SND — fuqaro bandligini ta’minlash, tadbirkorlik faoliyati bilan shug‘ullanish, kasbga tayyorlash va qayta tayyorlash hamda boshqa maqsadlar uchun kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlari tomonidan ajratilgan subsidiyalar va grantlar uchun hisoblanadigan o‘rtacha uch oylik normativ daromad;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666338">YTTND — yakka tartibdagi tadbirkorlik faoliyati bilan shug‘ullanuvchi va o‘zini o‘zi band qilgan fuqarolar uchun hisoblanadigan o‘rtacha uch oylik normativ daromadlar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666342">PO‘ — pul o‘tkazmalari, shu jumladan, chet elda ishlaydigan yoki chet elda tadbirkorlik va boshqa faoliyatni amalga oshiruvchi oila a’zolaridan uch oylik pul o‘tkazmalari summasi (mazkur Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda) yoki ularga hisoblanadigan uch oylik o‘rtacha normativ daromadlar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666343">PN — pensiya va nafaqalar ko‘rinishidagi uch oylik (mazkur Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda) daromadlar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666344">TD — tomorqa yer va/yoki dehqon xo‘jaligini yuritishdan (mazkur Nizomning 22-bandida belgilangan davrda) hisoblanadigan uch oylik o‘rtacha normativ daromadlar;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666378">ChM — chorva mollari va parrandalari mavjud bo‘lgan fuqarolarga hisoblanadigan uch oylik o‘rtacha normativ daromad;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666380">BD — oila a’zolarining uch oylik boshqa daromadlari;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666383">OAS — oila a’zolari soni”.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666387"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692180">35-band </a>quyidagi mazmundagi jumla bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666391">“Bunda 2024-yil 1-yanvardan boshlab nafaqa miqdorini qayta hisoblash “Yagona reyestr” AT tomonidan avtomatlashtirilgan tarzda manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralarning axborot tizimlaridan elektron shaklda taqdim etilgan ma’lumotlarga asosan amalga oshiriladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666396">quyidagi mazmundagi 35<sup>1</sup> va 35<sup>2</sup>-bandlar bilan to‘ldirilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666401">“35<sup>1</sup>. 2023-yil noyabr oyidan boshlab bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam oluvchi oilaning iqtisodiy ahvoli o‘zgarishi belgilangan tayinlash muddati yakuniga kadar har oyda (yangi tayinlangan hollarda keyingi to‘lov oyidan boshlab) to‘lov ro‘yxatlari shakllantirilgunga qadar qayta ariza talab etmagan holda manfaatdor vazirliklar va idoralarning axborot tizimlaridan elektron shaklda olingan ma’lumotlarga muvofiq avtomatik tarzda “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali qayta o‘rganiladi. Bunda manfaatdor vazirliklar va idoralarning axborot tizimlaridan ma’lumotlar elektron shaklda to‘liq yoki qisman olinmaganda joriy oy to‘lov ro‘yxatlari shakllantirilgunga qadar elektron shaklda olingan ma’lumotlarga asosan bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam to‘lovi to‘xtatish yoki davom ettirish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666403">Qayta o‘rganishda bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam oluvchi oila mazkur Nizomning 20-bandi “a”, “b”, “v”, “g”, “d” va “i” kichik bandlarida ko‘rsatilgan holatlar mavjud bo‘lganda keyingi to‘lov ro‘yxatlarini shakllantirishda bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam to‘lovi to‘xtatiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666405">Bunda 2023-yil 16-noyabrga qadar ariza bergan oilalarning iqtisodiy ahvoli o‘zgarishi mazkur Nizomning 20-bandi “v” kichik bandiga muvofiqligi 2023-yil 16-noyabrga qadar amalda bo‘lgan mezonlarga muvofiq qayta o‘rganiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666408">2023-yil 16-noyabrdan boshlab taqdim etilgan arizalar bo‘yicha ish izlab (xususan, aholi bandligi masalalari bo‘yicha maslahat olish uchun) kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish bo‘limlariga murojaat qilganligi sababli rasmiy bandlik talab etilmasdan bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam tayinlangan oila a’zosi bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam tayinlangan oydan boshlab 3 oy davomida kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organi orqali kasbga tayyorlash, malaka oshirish, qayta tayyorlash o‘quv kurslarida o‘qimasa, markazda ish izlovchi yoki ishsiz sifatida ro‘yxatga olinmasa, ishga joylashmasa, yakka tartibdagi tadbirkorlik faoliyati bilan shug‘ullanuvchi va o‘zini o‘zi band qilgan fuqarolar ro‘yxatiga kirmasa yoki kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlarining maqbul keladigan ishga doir takliflarini muntazam ravishda (ikki va undan ortiq marotaba) rad qilgan bo‘lsa keyingi oydan bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam to‘lovi to‘xtatiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666410">Bunda ushbu oila bolalar nafaqasi tayinlash uchun qayta murojaat qilgan hollarda to‘lov to‘xtatilgandan keyin 9 oy davomida, moddiy yordam tayinlash uchun qayta murojaat qilgan hollarda to‘lov to‘xtatilgandan keyin 3 oy davomida ish izlab (xususan, aholi bandligi masalalari bo‘yicha maslahat olish uchun) kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlariga murojaat qilgan oila a’zosiga nisbatan rasmiy bandlik talab etilmaslik bo‘yicha istisno qo‘llanilmaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666412">35<sup>2</sup>. 2024-yil 1-martdan boshlab — bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam olayotgan oilaning nomiga rasmiylashtirilmagan biroq foydalanuvida bo‘lgan avtotransport vositalari, ko‘chmas mulklari hamda chorva mollari ularning arizalarida ko‘rsatgan ma’lumotlarga muvofiqligi joyiga chiqqan holda fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi raisi, hokim yordamchisi, xotin-qizlar faoli, yoshlar yetakchisi va “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlari markazlarining ijtimoiy xodimlari tomonidan o‘rganib boriladi va ushbu Nizomga 6-ilovaga muvofiq shaklda dalolatnoma (keyingi o‘rinlarda — dalolatnoma) bilan rasmiylashtiriladi. Bunda dalolatnoma fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi raisi va kamida 2 nafar mas’ul xodimlar tomonidan tasdiqlanadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666414">O‘rganish natijalari “Yagona reyestr” ATga hokim yordamchisi, xotin-qizlar faoli va “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlari markazlarining ijtimoiy xodimlari tomonidan kiritiladi va axborot tizimi tomonidan bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam to‘lovini to‘xtatish yoki davom ettirish bo‘yicha avtomatik ravishda qaror qabul qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666417">Ushbu Nizomga 6-ilovaga asosan qayta o‘rganishda oilada mazkur Nizomning 20-bandi “b” kichik bandini ikkinchi xatboshida hamda “v”, “e” va “j” kichik bandlarida ko‘rsatilgan holatlar mavjud bo‘lganda keyingi to‘lov ro‘yxatlarini shakllantirishda bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam to‘lovi to‘xtatiladi. Bunda to‘lovni to‘xtatish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qilingan oilalarning bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam tayinlash uchun taqdim qilgan arizalari olti oy davomida ko‘rib chiqilmaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666420">Dalolatnoma bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlangandan so‘ng ikki oy ichida tuzilib, axborot dasturiga kiritilishi lozim. 2024-yil 1-mart holatiga bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam oluvchi oilalar bo‘yicha dalolatnoma 2024-yil 1-iyulgacha rasmiylashtirilib, “Yagona reyestr” ATga kiritiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666423">Belgilangan muddat ichida dalolatnoma tuzilmagan, dasturga kiritilmagan taqdirda, fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi raisi, hokim yordamchisi, xotin-qizlar faoli, yoshlar yetakchisi va “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlari markazlarining ijtimoiy xodimlariga ogohlantirish yuboriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666427">Belgilangan muddatdan keyin ham bir oy davomida dalolatnoma rasmiylashtirilmagan, axborot tizimiga kiritilmagan taqdirda, “Yagona reyestr” ATni yuritishga mas’ul bo‘lgan organ tomonidan ushbu xodimlarning ish beruvchi yuqori tashkilotiga tegishli choralar ko‘rish yuzasidan taqdimnoma kiritiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666430">Agar fuqaroning qarshiligi yoki doimiy ravishda (mas’ul xodimlar tomonidan 2-marta borilganda) uyda bo‘lmasligi natijasida mahallaning mas’ul xodimlari tomonidan bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam olayotgan oilaning moddiy ahvolini o‘rganish imkoni bo‘lmasa, bu haqda ushbu Nizomga 7-ilovaga muvofiq shaklda dalolatnoma rasmiylashtirilib, axborot dasturiga kiritiladi. Ushbu dalolatnoma axborot dasturiga kiritilgan oydan keyingi oyning 1-sanasidan bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam to‘lash vaqtincha to‘xtatiladi hamda bu haqda arizachiga SMS xabar yuboriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666433">Bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam vaqtincha to‘xtatilgandan keyin dalolatnoma rasmiylashtirilib, “Yagona reyestr” ATga kiritilsa ushbu bandning uchinchi xatboshisida belgilangan tartib amal qiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666436">Bunda bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam vaqtincha to‘xtatilgandan keyin 2 oy davomida o‘rganish dalolatnomasi rasmiylashtirilib, “Yagona reyestr” AT tomonidan to‘lovlarni davom ettirish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qilingan taqdirda to‘lov vaqtincha to‘xtatilgan oylar uchun bir yo‘la to‘lab beriladi. Biroq, bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam vaqtincha to‘xtatilgandan keyin ikki oy muddatdan keyin dalolatnoma rasmiylashtirilib, to‘lovlarni davom ettirish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qilingan taqdirda to‘lovlar keyingi oydan boshlab amalga oshiriladi hamda vaqtincha to‘xtatilgan oylar uchun to‘lovlar amalga oshirilmaydi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666451"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692186">39-band </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666452">“39. Bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordamni to‘lash quyidagi hollarda to‘xtatiladi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666453">a) qonunchilik hujjatlari bilan belgilangan tayinlash muddati tugaganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666454">b) ariza beruvchi yoki boshqa muomalaga layoqatli oila a’zosi tomonidan yashash joyi bo‘yicha Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limiga to‘lov to‘xtatilishini so‘rab ariza berganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666455">v) oila doimiy yashash uchun O‘zbekiston Respublikasi hududidan tashqariga ko‘chib ketganida;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666458">g) “Yagona reyestr” ATdagi yoki manfaatdor vazirliklar va idoralarning axborot tizimlari bilan idoralararo elektron o‘zaro hamkorlik tizimidagi texnik nosozlik natijasida, ma’lumotlar elektron ravishda to‘liq yoki qisman taqdim etilmaganligi sababli, shuningdek, arizani kiritishdagi texnik xatolar oqibatida noto‘g‘ri tayinlanganligi aniqlangan taqdirda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666459">d) “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam oluvchi oilalarning iqtisodiy ahvoli ushbu Nizomning 35<sup>1</sup> — 35<sup>2</sup> bandlarida ko‘rsatilgan tartibda qayta o‘rganish natijasida oila kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilmaganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666460">e) bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordamni tayinlash to‘g‘risidagi qarorga ta’sir ko‘rsatgan ariza beruvchi yoki fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi tomonidan noto‘g‘ri va ishonchsiz ma’lumotlar taqdim etilganligi yoki to‘liq taqdim etilmaganligi aniqlanganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666461">j) mazkur Nizomning 20-bandi “e” kichik bandida ko‘rsatilgan tashkilotlarning xizmatchilari va xodimlari yoki ularning oila a’zolari (turmush o‘rtog‘i va bolalari), shuningdek, pensionerlari tomonidan arizalar taqdim etilganligi aniqlanganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666463">z) mazkur Nizomning 20-bandi “j” kichik bandiga asosan Sudyalar va ularning oila a’zolari pensiya ta’minoti shartlari, me’yorlari hamda tartibi to‘g‘risidagi Nizomga asosan pensiyalar bilan ta’minlangan oila a’zolari mavjudligi aniqlanganda;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666465">i) ortiqcha to‘lovlar aniqlanganda to‘xtatiladi. Bunda ortiqcha to‘lovlar kam ta’minlangan oilaga kelgusi oylarda to‘lanishi lozim bo‘lgan bolalar nafaqasi yoki moddiy yordam uchun mablag‘lar hisobidan to‘liq chegirib qolingandan so‘ng to‘lovlar qayta amalga oshiriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666467">Mazkur bandning “g” va “d” kichik bandlariga asosan bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam to‘lovlari to‘xtatilgan holatlarda o‘tgan davrda to‘langan mablag‘lar qaytarilmaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666471">To‘lovlarni to‘xtatish (qonunchilik hujjatlari bilan belgilangan tayinlash muddati tugagan holatlar bundan mustasno) “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali avtomatlashtirilgan holda amalga oshiriladi va ariza beruvchiga elektron xabar (arizada ko‘rsatilgan elektron manziliga yoki SMS-xabarlar orqali mobil telefon raqamiga) yuborish orqali bildiriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666473">Ariza beruvchi bilan Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limi o‘rtasidagi to‘lovlar to‘xtatilishi yoki miqdori o‘zgarishi yuzasidan nizolar qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan tartibda, shu jumladan, sud orqali hal etiladi”;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666476"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692196">40-bandda</a>:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666485"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692196">birinchi xatboshi </a>“texnik sabablarga ko‘ra,” so‘zlaridan keyin “, shuningdek, mazkur Nizomning 39-bandi “e” kichik bandi bo‘yicha” so‘zlari bilan to‘ldirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666487">quyidagi mazmundagi yettinchi xatboshi bilan to‘ldirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666489">“Mazkur Nizomning 39-bandi “j” va “z” kichik bandlari bo‘yicha ortiqcha to‘lovlar vujudga kelganda mazkur bandning uchinchi — oltinchi xatboshilarida belgilangan tartib asosida undiriladi.”</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666491"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692202">yettinchi xatboshi </a>sakkizinchi xatboshi deb hisoblansin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666493"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692210">44-banddagi </a>“Tuman (shahar) moliya bo‘limi” so‘zlari “Tuman (shahar) iqtisodiyot va moliya bo‘limi” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666494"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692212">45-banddagi </a>“Moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari “Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi” so‘zlari bilan almashtirilsin;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666495"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692218">49</a>, <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692220">50 </a>va <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692221">51-bandlar </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666496">“49. Ajratiladigan budjet mablag‘laridan maqsadli foydalanilishi O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Davlat moliyaviy nazorat inspeksiyasi hamda Pensiya jamg‘armasining ichki audit xizmati tomonidan nazorat qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666497">Bunda bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam to‘g‘ri tayinlanganligi “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimidagi mavjud yoki manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralarning axborot tizimlaridan olingan ma’lumotlar asosida o‘rganiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666498">50. “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi bilan manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralarning axborot tizimlari o‘rtasidagi ma’lumotlar almashinuvi jarayonida texnik nosozliklar va uzilishlar yuzaga kelgan yoki elektron ma’lumotlarni to‘liq olinmagan hollarda, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi alohida axborot tizimlaridagi ma’lumot almashinuvini tegishli tizimlar to‘laqonli qayta ishga tushgunga qadar vaqtinchalik to‘xtatish hamda oilaning kam ta’minlanganligini avtomatik tarzda aniqlash algoritmiga o‘zgartirish kiritish hamda ko‘rib chiqish, mablag‘larni AT “Xalq banki”ga moliyalashtirish, to‘lov ro‘yxat (vedomost)larini yuborish muddatlarini uzaytirish huquqiga ega.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666499">51. Quyidagilar uchun:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666500">oila tarkibi, yashash joyining o‘zgarishi va oilaning chorva mollari va parrandalari hamda arizachi va uning oila a’zolari nomiga rasmiylashtirilmagan biroq foydalanuvida bo‘lgan avtotransport vositalari, noturar binolari, ko‘chmas mulklari, bog‘ va dehqon xo‘jalik yerlari mavjudligi to‘g‘risidagi axborotning ishonchliligi va o‘zgarishlar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlarni Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limini o‘z vaqtida xabardor qilish bo‘yicha — ariza beruvchiga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666501">AT “Xalq banki”ning maxsus hisobvaraqlariga budjet mablag‘larini o‘z vaqtida va to‘liq moliyalashtirish bo‘yicha — tuman (shahar) iqtisodiyot va moliya bo‘limi rahbariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666506">bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordamni tayinlash bo‘yicha arizalarni “Yagona reyestr” ATga belgilangan tartibda va o‘z vaqtida kiritish bo‘yicha — Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limi rahbariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666507">ariza beruvchi va uning oila a’zolari maqomini aniqlash, ariza beruvchining arizasi va unga ilova qilingan to‘liq to‘plamdagi hujjatlarni Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limiga o‘z vaqtida taqdim etish bo‘yicha — fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi raisiga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666508">“Yagona reyestr” ATni me’yoriy-huquqiy va texnik hujjatlarga asosan to‘g‘ri ishlashini ta’minlash, axborot tizimini takomillashtirib borish, axborot tizimi foydalanuvchilariga login va parol ochish (yopish), vazirlik va idoralarning axborot tizimlari bilan ma’lumot almashishini ta’minlash va yo‘lga qo‘yish, axborot tizimi orqali tegishli to‘lov ro‘yxatlarini shakllantirish hamda to‘lov ro‘yxatlarini AT “Xalq banki”ga yuborish bo‘yicha — Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Axborot texnologiyalari markazi rahbariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666509">oilani kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etish uchun “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali yuborilgan elektron so‘rovlarga o‘z vaqtida va to‘g‘ri (ishonchli) ma’lumotlarni elektron ravishda onlayn rejimida taqdim etilishi bo‘yicha — manfaatdor vazirlik va idoralar rahbarlariga;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666510">maxsus hisobvaraqlardagi mablag‘lar o‘z vaqtida va to‘liq to‘lanishini ta’minlash hamda oluvchilar tomonidan talab qilib olinmagan mablag‘larni tegishli mahalliy budjetga o‘z vaqtida va to‘liq qaytarish bo‘yicha — tuman (shahar) AT “Xalq banki” bo‘limi rahbarlariga shaxsiy javobgarlik yuklanadi”.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666511"><a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692497">2</a>, <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692811">3</a>, <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692865">3a</a>, <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5692935?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00">3b</a> va <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/5688101?ONDATE=21.10.2021 00#-5692963">4-ilovalar </a>quyidagi tahrirda bayon etilsin:</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666605"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6666606">“Kam ta’minlangan oilalarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali aniqlash, ularga kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash va to‘lash tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomga<br />2-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6666607">Kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam (ijtimoiy nafaqa) tayinlash va to‘lash</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6666608">SXEMASI</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666609"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666647"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="11%"><p align="center"><strong>Bosqichlar</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><strong>Subyektlar</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p align="center"><strong>Tadbirlar</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><strong>Bajarish muddatlari</strong></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="11%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="11%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ariza beruvchi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organiga yozma ariza beradi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Xohishiga ko‘ra, biroq joriy oyning 16-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="11%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="5" width="11%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="5" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ariza beruvchining oila a’zolari tarkibi, maqomini aniqlaydi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2 ish kuni mobaynida, biroq joriy oyning 18-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limiga ariza va to‘liq to‘plamdagi hujjatlarni taqdim etadi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Har 5 kunda, biroq joriy oyning 19-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="11%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="11%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimiga ma’lumotlarni kiritadi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Har kuni, biroq joriy oyning 26-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="11%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="4" width="11%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">4-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="4" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Oilaning har bir a’zosiga to‘g‘ri keladigan daromad miqdori aniqlanadi va belgilangan mezonlarga solishtiriladi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Ijtimoiy nafaqani tayinlash yoki tayinlashni rad etish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qilinadi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3. Tuman (shahar) mahalliy budjetida nazarda tutilgan mablag‘lar hajmidan kelib chiqib, arizalar keyingi oyda qayta ko‘rib chiqish uchun (kutish ro‘yxatlariga) o‘tkaziladi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">4. Ariza beruvchilarning mobil telefon raqamiga yoki elektron manziliga ijtimoiy nafaqa tayinlanganligi, tayinlash r�d etilganligi yoki ko‘rib chiqish uchun keyingi oyda (kutish ro‘yxatlariga) o‘tkazilganligi to‘g‘risida xabar yuboriladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ariza berilgan oydan keyingi oyning 1-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">5. Ijtimoiy nafaqalar to‘lash bo‘yicha elektron hujjatlar shakllantiriladi va AT “Xalq banki”ning bo‘limi (filiali)ga yuboriladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">To‘lov amalga oshiriladigan oyning 4-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="11%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="11%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">5-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Iqtisodiyot va moliya bo‘limi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ijtimoiy nafaqalar to‘lash uchun mablag‘larni AT “Xalq banki” bo‘limi (filiali)ning maxsus hisobvarag‘iga moliyalashtiradi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">To‘lov amalga oshiriladigan oyning 4-sanasidan 25-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="11%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="5" width="11%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">6-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="5" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">AT “Xalq banki” bo‘limi (filiali)</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Ijtimoiy nafaqa oluvchilarga to‘lovlarni amalga oshiradi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">To‘lov amalga oshiriladigan oyning 5-sanasidan 27-sanasiga kadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="19%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="43%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limlariga ijtimoiy nafaqa to‘lovlari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot taqdim etadi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 9.25pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3. To‘lanmagan mablag‘larni mahalliy budjetga qaytaradi va tuman (shahar) iqtisodiyot va moliya bo‘limlariga ma’lumot taqdim etadi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="19%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">To‘lov amalga oshirilgan oydan keyingi oyning 2-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666648"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6666649">Kam ta’minlangan oilalarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali aniqlash, ularga kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash va to‘lash tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomga<br />3-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6666650"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666651"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666652"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="50%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Budjetdan tashqari Pensiya jamg‘armasining</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">_____________________ tuman (shahar)</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(respublika, viloyat, shahar)</span></sup></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">bo‘limi boshlig‘iga</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Quyidagi manzilda yashaydigan fuqaro</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Mahalla _____________________</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">ko‘cha (kvartal) ________________</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Uy ____________________</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Kvartira __________________</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">______________________ tomonidan</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(ariza beruvchining F.I.O)</span></sup></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">ARIZA</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Sizdan mening oilamga qonunchilikda belgilangan ijtimoiy nafaqa (kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa yoki kam ta’minlangan oilalarga moddiy yordam) tayinlashingizni so‘rayman.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Arizaga quyidagilarni ilova qilaman:</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">□ pasport yoki shaxsni tasdiqlovchi boshqa hujjat nusxasi;</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">□ vasiylik va homiylik organining qarori nusxasi.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Boshqa hujjatlar: ________________________________</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Arizani ko‘rib chiqish to‘g‘risidagi xabarni quyida keltirilgan telefon raqamiga: +998___________ yoki elektron pochta _______________ga yuborishingizni so‘rayman.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limini oila tarkibi (bola tug‘ilganligi, vafot etganligi yoki boshqa holatlar), yashash joyim o‘zgarganligi va nafaqa (moddiy yordam) miqdoriga ta’sir ko‘rsatuvchi boshqa holatlar yoki o‘zgarishlar sodir bo‘lganda o‘z vaqtida xabardor qilish majburiyatini olaman. Taqdim etilgan hujjatlarning ishonchliligini kafolatlayman.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Mening va oila a’zolarimning ish haqlarini va boshqa barcha daromadlarini hamda mulkiy va moddiy holatimizning “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali tekshirilishiga hamda ijtimoiy nafaqa to‘lovini bank kartasi orqali amalga oshirilishiga rozilik beraman.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Bunda, AT “Xalq banki”da mening nomimga bank kartasi ochilmagan bo‘lsa, AT “Xalq banki”da nomimga yangi bank kartasini ochishda amaliy yordam berishingizni so‘rayman.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Murojaat qiluvchining imzosi: ________________</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Sana: 20 ____ y “____” ______________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Arizani ro‘yxatdan o‘tkazdim</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">___________________________</span></span></p><p align="center"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi mas’ul xodimi)</span></sup></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666808"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6666810">Kam ta’minlangan oilalarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali aniqlash, ularga kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash va to‘lash tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomga<br />3a-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6666812"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666815"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="50%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><a id="6666815"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oilaning mavjud chorva mollari va parrandalari, arizachi va uning oila a’zolari nomiga rasmiylashtirilmagan biroq foydalanuvida bo‘lgan avtotransport vositalari, bog‘ va dehqon xo‘jalik yerlari, ijarasidan yoki boshqa faoliyatdan olingan daromad ushbu oilaga kelib tushadigan noturar joylari to‘g‘risida</span></a></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">MA’LUMOT</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">__________________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">______________________________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(ariza beruvchining F.I.O)</span></sup></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt s