shbu ma’lumotlar haqqoniyligini mahallaga biriktirilgan mas’ul xodimlar tomonidan xonadonimga kelib o‘rganish o‘tkazishiga roziman.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ariza beruvchining imzosi: ___________________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Sana: 20___ y. “___” _____________.</span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666822"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6666826">Kam ta’minlangan oilalarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali aniqlash, ularga kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash va to‘lash tartibi to‘g‘risidagi nizomga<br />3b-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6666828"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666829"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666832"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="50%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal"></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" wi