 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p align="center"><strong>ARIZA</strong></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">20 yil holatiga ko‘ra, mening yoki oila a’zolarim nomiga ochilgan depozit hisobvaraqlaridagi qoldiq mablag‘lar va ularga hisoblangan foiz daromadlari hamda ariza berilgan sanadan oldingi uch oy mobaynida mening yoki oila a’zolarim nomiga olingan pul o‘tkazmalari to‘g‘risidagi hamda men va oila a’zolarimning kredit tarixiga oid ma’lumotlarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimiga taqdim etishingizni so‘raymiz.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ushbu ariza bilan men va oila a’zolarim tanishib, yuqorida ko‘rsatilgan ma’lumotlarning taqdim etilishiga rozilik berganimizni tasdiqlab imzo chekmoqdamiz.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="2"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ariza beruvchi _________________</span></p><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">20___ y. “___” __________.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDI