.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">07 — chaqiriq bo‘yicha harbiy xizmatni o‘tashi sababli oilada bo‘lmagan shaxs;</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">08 — harbiy ta’lim muassasasida ta’lim olishi sababli oilada bo‘lmagan shaxs;</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">09 — O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Mudofaa vazirligi, Ichki ishlar vazirligi, Favqulodda vaziyatlar vazirligi, Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti Davlat xavfsizlik xizmati, Milliy gvardiya, Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Bojxona qo‘mitasi, Mudofaa vazirligi huzuridagi Mudofaa sanoati agentligi hamda ularning tizimidagi tashkilotlar xizmatchilari va xodimlari hamda pensionerlari.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="60%" colspan="3"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="60%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi raisi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">______________</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="20%"><p align="cen