"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="50%" colspan="2"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">___________ tuman (shahar) va ________ mahalla fuqarolar yig‘ini raisi, hokim yordamchisi, yoshlar yetakchisi, xotin-qizlar faoli va “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlari markazining ijtimoiy xodimi tomonidan _________ ko‘chasi ______uyda yashovchi ______________________ F.I.O. oilasining iqtisodiy ahvoli va oila tarkibini o‘rganish maqsadida yashash manziliga chiqildi hamda o‘rganish imkoniyati bo‘lmadi.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. O‘rganish uchun birinchi marotaba chiqilgan sana __________.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">O‘rganish imkoniyati bo‘lmaganligi sababi (qarshilik ko‘rsatilgan, uyda yo‘q va boshqa)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">______________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">______________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">______________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">_____________________________________________________________________________________________.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. O‘rganish uchun ikkinchi marotaba chiqilgan sana _____________.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">O‘rganish imkoniyati bo‘lmaganligi sababi (qarshilik ko‘rsatilgan, uyda yo‘q va boshqa)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">_____________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">_____________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">_____________________________________________________________________________________________</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">____________________________________________________________________________________________.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Mahalla fuqarolar yig‘ini raisi:</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">F.I.O.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Hokim yordamchisi:</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">F.I.O.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Yoshlar yetakchisi:</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">F.I.O.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Xotin-qizlar faoli:</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">F.I.O.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlari markazining ijtimoiy xodimi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">F.I.O.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ijtimoiy nafaqa oluvchi oila a’zosi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">F.I.O.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="63%" colspan="2"><p align="left"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="36%"><p align="right"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">”.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666888">7. Quyidagi mazmundagi 2 va 3-ilovalar bilan to‘ldirilsin: </a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666893"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6666909">“Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2021-yil 21-oktabrdagi 654-son qaroriga<br />2-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6666919">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash, ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza berish bo‘yicha davlat xizmati ko‘rsatishning ma’muriy</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6666923">REGLAMENTI</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666926"></a></div><div class="TEXT_HEADER_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666927">1-bob. Umumiy qoidalar</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666934">1. Ushbu Reglament “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi (keyingi o‘rinlarda — “Yagona reyestr” AT) orqali oilalarni kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etish, kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza taqdim etish bo‘yicha davlat xizmati (keyingi o‘rinlarda — davlat xizmati) ko‘rsatish tartibini belgilaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666936">2. Ushbu Nizomda quyidagi asosiy tushunchalardan foydalaniladi:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666937"><strong>“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi —</strong> idoralararo elektron o‘zaro hamkorlikni qo‘llagan holda kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash, ularga bolalar nafaqasi va moddiy yordam tayinlash hamda davlat tomonidan ko‘rsatiladigan ijtimoiy xizmatlar va yordamni olish uchun murojaat qiluvchilar va oluvchilar to‘g‘risida yagona ma’lumotlar bazasini shakllantirish amalga oshiriladigan avtomatlashtirilgan axborot tizimi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666938"><strong>ariza beruvchi —</strong> oilaning 18 yoshga to‘lgan ijtimoiy nafaqa olish istagida bo‘lgan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi fuqarosi, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi hududida yashash guvohnomasiga ega bo‘lgan chet el fuqarosi yoki fuqaroligi bo‘lmagan shaxs;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666940"><strong>ijtimoiy nafaqa —</strong> kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666943"><strong>ma’lumotnoma —</strong> “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilgan oila (shaxs)ga O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Yagona interaktiv davlat xizmatlari portali (keyingi o‘rinlarda — YIDXP) orqali taqdim etiladigan, QR-kodga (matrik shtrixli kodga) ega bo‘lgan ma’lumotnoma;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666946"><strong>so‘rovnoma —</strong> davlat xizmatidan foydalanish uchun to‘ldiriladigan shakl.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666950">3. Davlat xizmati kam ta’minlangan oilaning 18 yoshga to‘lgan ijtimoiy nafaqa olish istagida bo‘lgan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi fuqarosi, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi hududida yashash guvohnomasiga ega bo‘lgan chet el fuqarosi yoki fuqaroligi bo‘lmagan shaxslarga (keyingi o‘rinlarda — ariza beruvchi) ko‘rsatiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666962">4. Davlat xizmati davlat xizmatlari markazlari yoki YIDXP orqali yoxud O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti huzuridagi Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi tomonidan ko‘rsatiladi va ijtimoiy nafaqa AT “Xalq banki”ning tuman (shahar) bo‘limlari (filiallari) tomonidan to‘lab beriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666965">5. Davlat xizmati ushbu Reglamentga 1 va 1a-ilovalarga muvofiq sxemaga muvofiq ko‘rsatiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666969">6. “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilgan oila (shaxs)ga YIDXP yoki davlat xizmatlari markazi orqali uch daqiqa ichida ushbu Reglamentga 2-ilovaga muvofiq shaklda ma’lumotnoma taqdim etiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666972">Ushbu ma’lumotnoma qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan xizmatlardan foydalanish va imtiyozlarni olish uchun taqdim etiladi va kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilgan oydan boshlab o‘n ikki oy davomida amal qiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666975">Agar bitta oila so‘nggi o‘n ikki oy davomida ketma-ket “Yagona reyestr” AT orqali bir necha marotaba:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666977">kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilgan bo‘lsa, bunda ma’lumotnomaning amal qilish muddati ushbu oila oxirgi marotaba kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilgan oydan boshlanadi;</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666979">kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilmagan bo‘lsa, bunda ma’lumotnomaning amal qilish muddati ushbu oila kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilmagan oydan keyingi oyning birinchi sanasida yakunlanadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666980">7. Davlat xizmatlari ko‘rsatilganligi uchun yig‘im undirilmaydi.</a></div><div class="TEXT_HEADER_DEFAULT"><a id="-6666982">2-bob. Davlat xizmati ko‘rsatish tartibi</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666987">8. Ariza beruvchi davlat xizmatidan foydalanish uchun davlat xizmatlari markaziga kelib murojaat qiladi, davlat xizmatlaridan elektron tarzda foydalanish uchun YIDXPdan ro‘yxatdan o‘tadi yoki “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlaridagi ijtimoiy xodimlarga murojaat qiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666990">9. Ariza beruvchi o‘zi kelib murojaat qilgan taqdirda davlat xizmatlari markazi xodimiga, “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlaridagi ijtimoiy xodimlar tomonidan “Yagona milliy ijtimoiy himoya” axborot tizimi orqali ariza beruvchi nomidan bevosita ularning roziligi bilan, YIDXP orqali murojaat qilishda mustaqil tarzda ushbu Reglamentga 3-ilovaga muvofiq shaklda elektron so‘rovnomani to‘ldiradi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666993">10. So‘rovnoma to‘ldirilgandan so‘ng ariza beruvchi to‘ldirilgan hamda idoralararo axborot almashinuvi tizimi orqali olingan ma’lumotlarni, shuningdek o‘zining oila a’zolari, shu jumladan, 18 yoshga to‘lgan oila a’zolari to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar to‘g‘riligini tekshirib, so‘rovnomani tasdiqlaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666994">Bunda ariza beruvchi tomonidan uning oila a’zolari to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlarda noaniqliklar va xatoliklar aniqlanganda, ushbu holatlar ariza beruvchi tomonidan tegishli organ bilan birgalikda 3 ish kuni ichida bartaraf etiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6666997">11. So‘rovnoma davlat xizmati olishni istayotgan oydan oldingi oyning 26-sanasiga qadar tasdiqlanishi lozim. Bunda yuqorida ko‘rsatib o‘tilgan muddatdan keyin berilgan arizalar belgilangan tartibda keyingi oyda ko‘rib chiqiladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667001">12. Ariza beruvchi tomonidan so‘rovnomada noto‘g‘ri ma’lumotlarning ko‘rsatilishi, uni tasdiqlashning rad etilishi, tegishli hujjatlar ilova qilinmaganda yoki ariza beruvchi oilasi “Yagona reyestr” ATda kam ta’minlangan oila sifatida ro‘yxatga olingan bo‘lsa davlat xizmatlari ko‘rsatishni rad etish uchun asos hisoblanadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667005">Davlat xizmatlari ko‘rsatishni boshqa asoslar bo‘yicha rad etish taqiqlanadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667010">13. Ariza beruvchi davlat xizmatidan foydalanishdan uni ko‘rsatishning har qanday bosqichida bosh tortish huquqiga ega. Ariza beruvchi davlat xizmatlaridan foydalanishdan bosh tortganda uning so‘rovnomasi ko‘rib chiqilmaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667016">14. Davlat xizmatlari markazi yoki YIDXP orqali ariza beruvchi tomonidan yuboriladigan so‘rovnoma tasdiqlangandan so‘ng “Yagona reyestr” ATga elektron shaklda yuboriladi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667019">15. So‘rovnoma “Yagona reyestr” AT tomonidan qabul qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667022">16. “Yagona reyestr” AT tomonidan, mazkur qaror bilan tasdiqlangan “Kam ta’minlangan oilalarni “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali aniqlash, ularga kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va moddiy yordam tayinlash va to‘lash tartibi to‘g‘risida”gi nizomda belgilangan mezonlarga asosan oilani kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etish, ijtimoiy nafaqa tayinlash yoki tayinlashni rad etish va ko‘rib chiqish uchun keyingi oyga (kutish ro‘yxatlariga) o‘tkazish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qilinadi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667025">17. Davlat xizmatini ko‘rsatish natijasi ariza beruvchining so‘rovnomada ko‘rsatilgan uyali telefon raqamiga yoki YIDXPga yuboriladi.</a></div><div class="TEXT_HEADER_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667030">3-bob. Yakunlovchi qoidalar</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667034">18. “Yagona reyestr” ATda ishlashga ruxsat berilgan tashkilot va idoralar o‘z faoliyatini amalga oshirish natijasida olingan ma’lumotlarning sir saqlanishini ta’minlaydi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667037">19. O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Adliya vazirligi hamda Raqamli texnologiyalar vazirligi ushbu Reglament talablari ijrosi bo‘yicha davlat organlari va boshqa tashkilotlarning faoliyatini doimiy nazorat qiladi hamda monitoring olib boradi.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667047">20. Ariza beruvchi mazkur davlat xizmatlarini ko‘rsatuvchi davlat organlari va boshqa tashkilotlar xodimlarining noqonuniy xatti-harakatlari yuzasidan qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan tartibda shikoyat qilishi mumkin.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667050">21. Ushbu Reglament talablarining buzilishida aybdor bo‘lgan shaxslar qonunchilik hujjatlarida belgilangan tartibda javob beradilar.</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667057"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6667059">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash, ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza berish bo‘yicha davlat xizmati ko‘rsatishning ma’muriy reglamentiga<br />1-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6667061">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilganligi to‘g‘risida ma’lumotnomani taqdim etish</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6667062">SXEMASI</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667070"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667076"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="11%"><p align="center"><strong>Bosqichlar</strong></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="B