-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="14%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ariza beruvchi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="49%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Davlat xizmatlari markaziga kelib murojaat qiladi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Yagona interaktiv davlat xizmatlari portalida (keyingi o‘rinlarda — YIDXP) ro‘yxatdan o‘tadi va so‘rovnomani to‘ldiradi, tekshiradi va tasdiqlaydi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3. Mahalla fuqarolar yig‘inidagi “Inson” ijtimoiy xizmatlar markazlaridagi ijtimoiy xodimlar tomonidan murojaat qiladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Xohishiga ko‘ra, biroq har oyning 26-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BO