2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="14%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="49%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="12%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">5-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="14%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="49%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Oilaning har bir a’zosiga to‘g‘ri keladigan daromad miqdorini aniqlaydi va belgilangan mezonlarga solishtiradi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. Ijtimoiy nafaqani tayinlash yoki tayinlashni rad etish to‘g‘risida qaror qabul qiladi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">3. Tuman (shahar) budjetida nazarda tugilgan mablag‘lar hajmidan kelib chiqib, arizalarni keyingi oyda qayta ko‘rib chiqish uchun (kutish ro‘yxatlariga) o‘tkazadi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">4. Ariza beruvchilarning uyali telefon raqamiga yoki YIDXPga ijtimoiy nafaqa tayinlanganligi, tayinlash rad etilganligi yoki ko‘rib chiqish uchun keyingi oyda (kutish ro‘yxatlariga) o‘tkazilganligi to‘g‘risidagi xabarni yuboradi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ariza berilgan oydan keyingi oyning 1-sanasiga qadar</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="12%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="14%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="49%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="16%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="12%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">6-bosqich</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="14%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">1. Davlat xizmatlari markazi</span></p><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">2. YIDXP</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="49%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Nafaqa tayinlangan taqdirda, nafaqani qachon va qayerdan olish to‘g‘risida murojaat qiluvchini xabardor qiladi.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 13.95pt"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Nafaqa tayinlash rad etilgan taqdirda, rad etish sabablari to‘g‘risida murojaat qiluvchini xabardor qiladi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="2" width="16%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-WEIGHT: normal">Ma’lumot olinganidan so‘ng 5 daqiqada</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="2%"><p align="center"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><a id="-6667104">Izoh. Mobil ilova orqali elektron ariza taqdim etishda xam ushbu sxema qo‘llaniladi.</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667133"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6667134">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash, ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza berish bo‘yicha davlat xizmati ko‘rsatishning ma’muriy reglamentiga<br />2-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6667135"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667136"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667137"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="50%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" v