DDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%" colspan="2"><p align="center"><span>Tug‘ilgan sanasi</span></p><p align="center"><span>(kun/oy/yil)</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p align="center"><span>Jinsi</span></p><p align="center"><span>(ayol/erkak)</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="26%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span>Pasport</span></p><p align="center"><span>(identifikatsiyalovchi ID-karta)</span></p><p align="center"><span>ma’lumotlari</span></p><p align="center"><span>(seriya/raqami)</span></p><p align="center"><span>JShShIR</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p align="center"><span>Oila a’zosining maqomi</span></p><p align="center"><span>(ariza beruvchiga nisbatan)</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm" valign="top" width="5%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm" valign="top" width="17%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm" valign="top" width="13%" colspan="2"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="17%"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="26%" colspan="3"><p></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="20%"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="9"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span>Fuqaro arizasi raqami: ___________________.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="9"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span>Fuqaroning yashash manzili: _______________ viloyati (Qoraqalpog‘iston Respublikasi, Toshkent shahar), _______________ tuman (shahar), _______________ (fuqarolarning o‘zini o‘zi boshqarish organi), _____ uy, _____ xonadon.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="9"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span>Oilasi kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etilgan oy/yil: ______________.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="9"><p></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 0cm; PADDING-RIGHT: 0cm" valign="top" width="75%" colspan="7"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span>Ushbu hujjat Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2017-yil 15-sentabrdagi 728-son qarori bilan tasdiqlangan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Yagona interaktiv davlat xizmatlari portali to‘g‘risidagi nizomga muvofiq shakllantirilgan elektron hujjatning nusxasi hisoblanadi.</span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="3" width="4%"><p align="center"><span><strong>T</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>e</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>k</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>sh</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>i</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>r</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>u</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>v</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>k</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>o</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>d</strong></span></p><p align="center"><span><strong>i</strong></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" rowspan="3" width="20%"><p align="center"><span>Hujjatning haqiqiyligini tasdiqlovchi QR-kod</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="75%" colspan="7"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span>Elektron hujjatning nusxasida ko‘rsatilgan ma’lumotlar to‘g‘riligini tekshirish uchun edoc.gov.uz veb-saytiga o‘ting va elektron hujjatning noyob raqamini kiriting yoki mobil telefon yordamida QR-kodni (matrik shtrixli kodni) skaner qiling.</span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="75%" colspan="7"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 35.55pt"><span>Diqqat! Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2017-yil 15-sentabrdagi 728-son qaroriga muvofiq elektron hujjatlardagi ma’lumotlar qonuniy hisoblanadi. Davlat organlariga Yagona portalda shakllantirilgan elektron hujjatlarning nusxalarini qabul qilishni rad etishlari qat’iyan taqiqlangan.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667155"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6667156">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan oilalarni aniqlash, ularga ijtimoiy nafaqalar tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza berish bo‘yicha davlat xizmati ko‘rsatishning ma’muriy reglamentiga<br />3-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6667157"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667158"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667160"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="50%" border="0"><tbody><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="49%" colspan="2"><p align="center"><a id="6667160"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">____________</span></a></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="51%" colspan="4"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">____________</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="49%" colspan="2"><p align="center"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(sana)</span></sup></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="51%" colspan="4"><p align="center"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(raqam)</span></sup></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="49%" colspan="2"><p><span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="51%" colspan="4"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="6"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali kam ta’minlangan deb e’tirof etish, kam ta’minlangan oilalar bolalari uchun nafaqa va kam ta’minlangan oilalarga moddiy yordam tayinlash hamda ma’lumotnoma olish uchun elektron ko‘rinishda ariza berish davlat xizmati ko‘rsatish bo‘yicha</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="6"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">SO‘ROVNOMA</span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="6"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%