M: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="79%" colspan="3"><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Davlat raqami belgisi</span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="15%" colspan="2"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="6%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.3</span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="79%" colspan="3"><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Daromad olib keluvchi noturar binolari soni</span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="15%" colspan="2"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="6%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.4</span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="79%" colspan="3"><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Sug‘oriladigan bog‘ va dehqon xo‘jaligi yerlari maydoni (sotix)</span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="15%" colspan="2"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="6%"><p align="center"><span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="79%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">III. Ilova qilinadigan hujjatlar:</span></b></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="15%" colspan="2"><p><span></span></p></td></tr><tr style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt"><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="50%" colspan="3"><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">16. Boshqa hujjatlar:</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 21pt"><span><sup><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">(mavjud bo‘lsa)</span></sup></span></p><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">vasiylik va homiylik organining qarori;</span></span></p><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">chet el oliy ta’lim muassasasi talabasi ekanligini tasdiqlovchi ma’lumotnoma;</span></span></p><p><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">O‘zbekiston Respublikasining Markaziy banki va tijorat banklari rahbarlariga, “Kredit-axborot tahliliy markazi” Kredit byurosi MChJga ariza.</span></span></p></td><td style="HEIGHT: 14.2pt; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="50%" colspan="3"><p><span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667162">So‘rovnomada rozilik beriladigan ofertalar:</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667185">1) Pensiya jamg‘armasi bo‘limini oila tarkibi (bola tug‘ilganligi, vafot etganligi yoki boshqa holatlar), yashash joyim o‘zgarganligi va nafaqa (moddiy yordam) miqdoriga ta’sir ko‘rsatuvchi boshqa holatlar yoki o‘zgarishlar sodir bo‘lganda o‘z vaqtida xabardor qilish majburiyatini olaman. Taqdim etilgan hujjatlarning ishonchliligini kafolatlayman.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667189">Mening va oila a’zolarimning ish haqlarini va boshqa barcha daromadlarini hamda mulkiy va moddiy holatimizning “Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimi orqali tekshirilishiga hamda ijtimoiy nafaqa to‘lovini bank kartasi orqali amalga oshirilishiga rozilik beraman.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667191">Bunda AT “Xalq banki”da mening nomimga bank kartasi ochilmagan bo‘lsa, AT “Xalq banki”da nomimga yangi bank kartasini ochishda amaliy yordam berishingizni so‘rayman.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667195">2) Xo‘jaligimizda mavjud chorva mollari, parrandalari soni, oila a’zolarim nomiga rasmiylashtirilmagan biroq oilamning foydalanuvida bo‘lgan avtotransport vositalari, noturar binolari, qo‘shimcha turar ko‘chmas mulklari hamda bog‘ va dehqon xo‘jaligi yerlari to‘g‘risida taqdim etilgan ma’lumotlarning ishonchliligi uchun javobgarlikni tushunaman va to‘liq qabul qilaman hamda yuqorida qayd etilgan ma’lumotlarning noto‘g‘riligi aniqlangan taqdirda, qonunchilik hujjatlariga muvofiq javob berishim haqida xabardorman.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667198">Ushbu ma’lumotlar haqqoniyligini mahalla fuqarolar yig‘iniga biriktirilgan mas’ul xodimlar tomonidan xonadonimga kelib o‘rganish o‘tkazishiga roziman.</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667213"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6667216">Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2021-yil 21-oktabrdagi 654-son qaroriga<br />3-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6667219">“Ijtimoiy himoya yagona reyestri” axborot tizimidagi idoralararo elektron o‘zaro axborot almashinuvi doirasidagi ma’lumotlar</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6667224">RO‘YXATI<a href="javascript:scrollText(-6667365)">*</a></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667232"></a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667237"><table style="BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" width="100%" border="0"><tbody><tr><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="3%"><p align="center"><a id="6667237"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">T/r</span></b></a></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="22%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Tashkilot nomi</span></b></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-TOP: windowtext 1pt solid; BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="74%"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Talab etiladigan ma’lumotlar</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><span><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">I. Vazirliklar, davlat qo‘mitalari va idoralar bo‘yicha</span></b></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Mahalliy budjetda va boshqa manbalarda ijtimoiy nafaqa va moddiy yordam xarajatlari uchun nazarda tutilgan mablag‘larning rejasi to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Oliy ta’lim tashkilotlari tomonidan hisoblangan stipendiyalar miqdori to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Qimmatli qog‘ozlar, qimmatli qog‘ozlar bilan amalga oshirgan operatsiyalar, olingan dividendlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. Uy-joy sotib olish uchun fuqarolarga berilgan subsidiyalar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumot.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.1</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Soliq qo‘mitasi</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Mehnatga haq to‘lash tarzidagi daromadlar, mulkiy daromadlar, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi qonunchilik hujjatlari bilan belgilangan daromadlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Jismoniy shaxsning yakka tartibdagi tadbirkor, yollangan xodim sifatidagi maqomi va to‘langan qat’iy soliq summasi to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. O‘zini o‘zi band qilgan shaxslar va to‘langan ijtimoiy soliq to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. Korxonalarning ta’sischilari va ta’sis etilgan korxonaning ustav fondidagi ulushi to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5. Jismoniy shaxslarga hisoblangan mol-mulk va yer solig‘i to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.2</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi Kadastr agentligi</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ko‘chmas mulk obyekti to‘g‘risida ma’lumot:</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Ko‘chmas mulk manzili va kadastr raqami to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Yakka tartibdagi uy-joyning umumiy yer maydoni va qurilishi osti maydoni to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Dehqon xo‘jaliklarining yer maydoni to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.3</span></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Iqtisodiyot va moliya vazirligi huzuridagi budjetdan tashqari Pensiya jamg‘armasi</span></span><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt"><a href="-http://cli.lex.uz/ld/lps/doc/6663873#-6667367"><span style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: teal; text-underline: none">***</span></a></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Pensiya va ijtimoiy nafaqa oluvchilar va ularga to‘langan pensiya, ijtimoiy nafaqa va boshqa to‘lovlar miqdorlari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. O‘zgalar parvarishiga muhtoj 80 yoshga to‘lgan keksalarni yoki I guruh nogironligi bo‘lgan shaxsni parvarish qilayotganlar shaxslar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlikka ko‘maklashish organlariga murojaat qiluvchilar (ishsiz, ish izlovchi, ishsizlik nafaqasi va boshqalar) to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Jamoat ishlarida qatnashganlar va ularga to‘langan oylik ish haqi to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Fuqarolarga vazirlik tizimidagi jamg‘armalar tomonidan berilgan subsidiyalar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. Tashk�llashtirilgan holda chet elga vaqtincha ishga yuborilganlik to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumotlar.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.1</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ijtimoiy himoya milliy agentligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Nogironligi bo‘lgan shaxslar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Yakka-yolg‘iz shaxslarga ajratilgan bepul oziq-ovqat mahsulotlari va gigiyena vositalari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Bolalar uyi, “Muruvvat” va “Saxovat” internat uylarida tarbiyalanayotgan shaxslar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. “Muruvvat” va “Saxovat” internat uylarida tarbiyalanayotgan shaxslar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5. Protez-ortopediya moslamalari, reabilitatsiya qilishning texnik vositalari va harakatlanish vositalari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.2</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Kambag‘allikni qisqartirish va bandlik vazirligi huzuridagi Mahallabay ishlash va tadbirkorlikni rivojlantirish agentligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Aholini tadbirkorlikka jalb qilish yo‘nalishida berilgan subsidiyalar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. “Onlayn mahalla” elektron platformasiga kiritilgan oilalar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Sog‘likni saqlash vazirligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Bepul tibbiy xizmatlar olish uchun berilgan orderlar.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Ruhiy kasalliklar bo‘yicha dispanser hisobida turganligi to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Onkologik kasalliklar bilan uzoq muddatli davolanishda bo‘lgan shaxslar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. Mehnatga layoqatsizlik varaqalari va ushbu varaqalar rasmiylashtirilgan shaxslar to‘g‘risidagi ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ichki ishlar vazirligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Jismoniy shaxslarning mulkida bo‘lgan yoki ishonchnoma asosida foydalanilayotgan avtotransport vositasi (ishlab chiqarilgan sana, turi, markasi, texnik holati va boshqalar) to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Fuqarolarga berilgan pasportlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. O‘zbekiston Respublikasida doimiy yashaydigan chet el fuqarolari va fuqaroligi bo‘lmagan shaxslarga berilgan yashash guvohnomalari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. Fuqarolarning doimiy yashash joyi bo‘yicha va vaqtincha turgan joyi bo‘yicha ro‘yxatga olinganligi t�g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5. Jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida bo‘lgan, shu jumladan chet elda jazoni ijro etish muassasalarida bo‘lgan shaxslar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">6. “Dastlabki ijtimoiy-moddiy yordam paketi”ni oluvchilar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Maktabgacha va maktab ta’limi vazirligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Maktabgacha ta’lim tashkilotlari tarbiyalanuvchilari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Vasiylikka va homiylikka olingan bolalar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Mehribonlik uylari tarbiyalanuvchilari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">4. O‘n sakkiz yoshdan oshgan maktab o‘quvchilari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">5. Yetim bolalar va ota-onasining qaramog‘idan mahrum bo‘lgan o‘quvchilarni uy-joy bilan ta’minlash “Onlayn navbat” axborot tizimiga kiritilgan bolalar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">6. Kam ta’minlangan oilalarning a’zolariga ko‘rsatilgan ijtimoiy xizmatlar (ota-onalar to‘lovi bo‘yicha imtiyozlar va boshqalar) to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">7. Kam ta’minlangan oilalarning a’zolariga ko‘rsatilgan ijtimoiy xizmatlar (bepul qishki kiyim-bosh, darsliklar to‘plami, ota-onalar to‘lovida imtiyozlar va boshqalar) to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">6.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Oliy ta’lim, fan va innovatsiyalar vazirligi<a href="-http://cli.lex.uz/ld/lps/doc/6663873#-6667366"><span style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; COLOR: teal; text-underline: none">**</span></a></span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Talaba (tinglovchi)lar (ta’lim tashkiloti, uqish shakli, o‘qish turi, ta’lim kursi, yo‘nalishi va boshqalar) to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">7.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Transport vazirligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Fuqarolarning ayrim toifalariga transport (shahar, havo, temir yo‘l)da imtiyozli yurish bo‘yicha berilgan imtiyozlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Yo‘lovchi tashish xizmati bilan shug‘ullanadigan yuridik shaxslar tomonidan litsenziyalar berilgan avtotransport vositalari va ularning egalari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">8.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Adliya vazirligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Oila a’zolarining fuqarolik holati to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Oila tarkibi to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Qayd etilgan fuqarolik holatlari (tug‘ilganlik, nikoh qayd etilganli�i, vafot etganlik va boshqalar) to‘g‘risida shu jumladan, chet elda qayd etilgan holatlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">8.1</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Adliya vazirligi huzuridagi Personallashtirish agentligi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Ariza beruvchi va uning oila a’zolariga biriktirilgan JShShIRlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. O‘zbekiston Respublikasidan chiqib ketgan va O‘zbekiston Respublikasiga kelgan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi fuqarosi, O‘zbekiston Respublikasi hududida yashash guvohnomasiga ega bo‘lgan chet el fuqarosi yoki fuqaroligi bo‘lmagan shaxslar to‘g‘risida hamda ularning chet elga borish maqsadlari, yoshi va mamlakatlari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">9.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Markaziy bank</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. Jismoniy shaxslarning depozit hisobvaraqlaridagi mablag‘lar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Olingan pul o‘tkazmalari to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. “Har bir oila — tadbirkor” dasturi doirasida kredit olgan jismoniy shaxslar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">10.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Bosh prokuratura huzuridagi Majburiy ijro byurosi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Jismoniy shaxslar tomonidan to‘langan va olingan alimentlar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="100%" colspan="3"><p align="center"><b><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">II. Boshqa tashkilotlar bo‘yicha</span></b></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">AT “Xalq banki”</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">1. To‘langan (to‘lanmagan) bolalar nafaqasi, moddiy yordam va boshqa to‘lovlar, qaytarilgan mablag‘lar hamda hisobvaraqlardagi qoldiq mablag‘lar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2. Fuqarolar nomiga ochilgan va aktiv bo‘lgan bank plastik kartalar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">3. Nafaqa va moddiy yordam va boshqa to‘lovlar uchun moliyalashtirilgan, to‘langan va to‘lanmasdan tegishli mahalliy budjetga qaytarilgan mablag‘lar miqdorlari va nafaqa oluvchilar to‘g‘risida ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; BORDER-LEFT: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="3%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">2.</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="22%"><p align="center"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">O‘zbekiston B�nklari assotsiatsiyasi</span></p></td><td style="BORDER-RIGHT: windowtext 1pt solid; BACKGROUND: white; BORDER-BOTTOM: windowtext 1pt solid; PADDING-BOTTOM: 0cm; PADDING-TOP: 0cm; PADDING-LEFT: 2.85pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 2.85pt" valign="top" width="74%"><p style="TEXT-INDENT: 11.85pt"><span style="FONT-SIZE: 12pt">Ariza beruvchi va uning oila a’zolarining kredit tarixiga oid ma’lumot.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></a></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><a id="-6667365">* Real vaqt rejimida ma’lumotlar bazasiga kirish dasturiy kompleks va ma’lumotlar bazasi tuzilmasiga aralashish huquqisiz JShShIRga asosan beriladi.</a></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><a id="-6667366">** O‘zbekiston Respublikasidagi davlat, nodavlat va xorijiy oliy ta’lim tashkilotlari xamda kasb-hunar maktablari, kollejlar, texnikumlar, akademik litseylar bo‘yicha taqdim etiladi.</a></div><div class="FOOTNOTE"><a id="-6667367">*** Pensiya jamg‘armasi tomonidan moliyalashtiriladigan pensiyalar, ijtimoiy nafaqalar, kompensatsiyalar va boshqa to‘lovlar bo‘yicha ma’lumotlar taqdim etiladi”.</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667368"></a></div><div class="APPL_BANNER_LANDSCAPE_TITLE"><a id="-6667369">Vazirlar Mahkamasining 2023-yil 10-noyabrdagi 596-son <a href="javascript:scrollText()">qaroriga</a><br />2-ILOVA</a></div><div class="ACT_TITLE_APPL"><a id="-6667370">O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb e’tirof etilayotgan ayrim qarorlari</a></div><div class="ACT_FORM"><a id="-6667371">RO‘YXATI</a></div><div class="BY_DEFAULT"><a id="-6667372"></a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667373">1. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Aholini ijtimoiy himoya qilish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish hamda sohaga zamonaviy axborot-kommunikatsiya texnologiyalarini keng joriy etish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 5-martdagi 122-son qarorining <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5319768?ONDATE=05.03.2021 00#-5320103">10-bandi </a>va unga <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-5319768?ONDATE=05.03.2021 00#-5321638">2-ilova</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667374">2. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim qarorlariga o‘zgartirishlar kiritish, shuningdek, ba’zilarini o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblash to‘g‘risida (O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining “Kapital bozorini yanada rivojlantirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 13-apreldagi PF-6207-son Farmoni hamda “Kapital bozorini tartibga solish tizimini yanada takomillashtirish chora-tadbirlari to‘g‘risida” 2021-yil 13-apreldagi PQ-5073-son qarori)” 2022-yil 9-iyundagi 323-son qaroriga 1-ilovaning <a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/6057471?ONDATE=10.06.2022 00#-6057955">6-bandi</a>.</a></div><div class="ACT_TEXT"><a id="-6667375">3. Vazirlar Mahkamasining “Oila va xotin-qizlar bilan ishlash, mahalla va nuroniylarni qo‘llab-quvvatlash tizimi takomillashtirilishi munosabati bilan O‘zbekiston Respublikasi Hukumatining ayrim hujjatlariga o‘zgartirish va qo‘shimchalar kiritish, shuningdek, ba’zilarini o‘z kuchini yo‘qotgan deb hisoblash to‘g‘risida” 2022-yil 9-avgustdagi 438-son qaroriga 1-ilovaning<a href="http://lex.uz/uz/docs/-6148240?ONDATE=10.08.2022 00#-6150179"> 76-bandi</a>.</a></div><br /><div class="PUBLICATION_ORIGIN"><label id="s1089"></label><a id="-6665760">(Qonunchilik ma’lumotlari milliy bazasi, 16.11.2023-y., 09/23/596/0856-son)</a></div></div>
</div>
</body>
</html>